    "intro": "Today's nightly is a deep reliability pass: chat sessions recover more gracefully from storage and model failures, the status page stops flapping on benign freshness lag, the desktop harness no longer trips over leftover sidecar processes, and a long-standing hidden-window reveal deadlock on desktop is finally unblocked.",
