        "title": "Desktop harness reclaims stale sidecars on launch",
        "summary": "Desktop startup gets two fixes that prevent the local harness from getting stuck behind a leftover process or an inherited environment variable.",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "On launch, Desktop now detects and terminates stale managed harness sidecars that are still holding the local port, so a previous crashed run can no longer block the new bundled sidecar from starting.",
            "commit_shas": [
