            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "text": "An inherited AURA_HARNESS_BIN pointing at a previous build's staged sidecar is now ignored, letting the current bundled harness restage cleanly instead of running an outdated binary.",
            "commit_shas": [
